# Allowlist .gitignore for the constellation orchestrator repo (~/GitHub/).
# Strategy: ignore everything at the repo root, then re-include only the
# orchestrator paths, then drop junk that lives INSIDE the included subtree.

# 1. Ignore every entry at the repo root.
/*

# 2. Re-include the orchestrator paths (and this file).
#    Claude and Codex own independent versioned entry points.
#    Retired projection archives stay ignored if restored locally.
!/.claude/
!/.codex/
!/CLAUDE.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/QUANTOS.md
!/README.md
!/REVIEW.md
!/.github/
!/.gitignore

# 3. Drop junk that lives inside the re-included .claude/ subtree.
#    These match at any depth under an already-included directory.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
**/.DS_Store
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# 4. Belt-and-braces: caches that could appear inside .claude/ later.
**/.venv/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.playwright-mcp/

# 5. Per-session Bash run ledgers (command + exit-code evidence consumed by
#    evidence_audit). Ephemeral — never committed. The DURABLE research ledger
#    is the commit-trailer history, not these files.
/.claude/run/

# Private legacy archive path; never stage its contents if restored locally.
/.codex_NOTUSE/
